<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-GREGG MOORE WINS DETROIT GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-GREGG MOORE WINS DETROIT GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-06-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gregg Moore won the Detroit Grand Prix Indy car race driving a Reynard Mercedes-Benz on Sunday.</p>
<p>Michael Andretti of the United States finished second and Gil de Ferran of Brazil finished third.</p>
</text>
